{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210750-just-for-fun-house-marching-songs","id":1210750,"title":"(Just for fun) House Marching Songs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-23T19:18:16-07:00","id":1210750,"title":"(Just for fun) House Marching Songs","content":"I came up with, of all things, a small Cathak marching song today:<br /> <br /> (Sung to the tune of &quot;When Johnny Comes Marching Home/The Ants Go Marching One By One&quot;)<br /> <br /> We children of Cathak we march to war, to war<br /> to show our martial might we march to war, to war<br /> to show our shining steel, we fight<br /> under the scarlet banners' light<br /> and Cathak goes marching out to victory<br /> <br /> To honor Cathak flame we march to war, to war<br /> strong under Mela's grace we march to war, to war<br /> our swords unsheated against the world<br /> our scarlet banners be unfurl'd<br /> and Cathak goes marching out to victory<br /> <br /> Anybody else got any Dragonblood marching songs they've thought of?<br /> <br /> Edit: I've got another one for Tepet:<br /> <br /> (Sung to the tune of &quot;The British Grenadiers&quot;)<br /> <br /> Some talk of Anaxandor, and some of Verites,<br /> of Cathak and Kamahdur, and such great names as these.<br /> But of all the world's great heroes, there's none that can compare<br /> with a tow, row, row, row, row, row, to the Tepet legionnaires.<br /> <br /> When'er we are commanded, to storm the palisades<br /> our leaders march with daiklaves, and we with shield and blades.<br /> We shout cries from the glacis, while gleaming trumpet blares.<br /> With a tow, row, row, row, row, row, to the Tepet legionnaires.<br /> <br /> Then let us fill a flagon, and drink the health of those<br /> who carry helms and lances, and wear the azure clothes.<br /> May they and their commanders live long with fortune fair.<br /> With a tow, row, row, row, row, row, to the Tepet legionnaires.<br /> <br /> The line about living happy all their years/long with fortune fair was just too bitterly perfect to pass up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 04-24-2018, 12:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T02:44:26-07:00","id":1210873,"title":"","content":"These are great! Could you be persuaded to do one with &quot;By the Rising of the Moon&quot;? or maybe that is more a lunar song...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T04:16:43-07:00","id":1210893,"title":"","content":"I just had an amusing thought of House Mnemon marching along to an adapted rendition of &quot;When the Saints go Marching in&quot;<br /> <br /> For those unfamiliar with the song, linked below is the Louis Armstrong version, because... Louis Armstrong:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyLjbMBpGDA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyLjbMBpGDA\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyLjbMBpGDA\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyLjbMBpGDA </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/258-thesarcasticsage","name":"TheSarcasticSage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T07:06:30-07:00","id":1210940,"title":"","content":"So just imagine <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HiqmZLOaD8o\" target=\"_blank\">this song</a> except with all the genders reversed and you have an idea of what I imagine the Realm sounds like marching to war. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted is an aesthetic.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5526-steamfunk","name":"Steamfunk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5526_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T07:18:25-07:00","id":1210946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>light-hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210750-just-for-fun-house-marching-songs?p=1210873#post1210873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These are great! Could you be persuaded to do one with &quot;By the Rising of the Moon&quot;? or maybe that is more a lunar song...</div> </div> </div> </div>...I'm not sure that it even needs to be changed that much. I mean, just replace the word &quot;Ireland&quot; with the name of a gaelic-themed satrapy, and you're good to go.<br /> <br /> But if I can think of something specific down the line, I'll give it a shot.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T14:31:15-07:00","id":1211157,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CwED4C5FJuo\" target=\"_blank\">This one</a> goes for all girls and guys riding in vermillion. Red piss and bloody eyes you great bastards.<br /> <br /> And yeah, i can imagine Roseblack singing that like there's no tomorrow along with the troops, she's Wood aspect after all.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Reference to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOeYPpOblAw\" target=\"_blank\">a more traditional marching tune</a> as a nice bonus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 04-24-2018, 05:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-27T06:02:00-07:00","id":1212243,"title":"","content":"Wrote up a little thing loosely based on a passage of the Ballad of the White Horse. <br /> <br /> Legion marching song:<br /> <br /> <i>Build my pyre upon the earth,<br /> wherever I may fall,<br /> I'd sooner sleep in ash and dust,<br /> than a prince's marble hall.<br /> <br /> Lift not by body from the ground,<br /> I'll rest on bloodied loam,<br /> for all the world's the dragon's Realm,<br /> and I shall die at home. </i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-27T06:31:26-07:00","id":1212249,"title":"","content":"They say that in the Legion the wine's mighty fine<br /> It looks like muddy water and tastes like turpentine<br /> Chorus:<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go<br /> But they won't let me go<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go hoo-hoo-hoooome EH!<br /> They say that in the Legion the chow is mighty fine<br /> A chicken jumped off the table and started marking time<br /> Chorus:<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go<br /> But they won't let me go<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go hoo-hoo-hoooome EH!<br /> They say that in the Legion the biscuits are mighty fine<br /> One rolled off the table and killed a friend of mine<br /> Chorus:<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go<br /> But they won't let me go<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go hoo-hoo-hoooome EH!<br /> They say that in the Legion the training's might fine<br /> Last night there were ten of us, now there's only nine<br /> Chorus:<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go<br /> But they won't let me go<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go hoo-hoo-hoooome EH!<br /> They say that in the Legion the pay is mighty fine<br /> They give you a hundred jade and take back ninety-nine<br /> Chorus:<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go<br /> But they won't let me go<br /> Oh Dragons, I wanna go hoo-hoo-hoooome EH<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThe very existence of flame-throwers proves that some time, somewhere, someone said to themselves, You know, I want to set those people over there on fire, but I'm just not close enough to get the job done.\u201d George Carlin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/123-trax","name":"Trax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar123_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-27T06:35:15-07:00","id":1212250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210750-just-for-fun-house-marching-songs?p=1212243#post1212243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">for all the world's the dragon's Realm,<br /> and I shall die at home. [/I]</div> </div> </div> </div>Whoa! Serious goosebumps there. Love it!<br /> <br /> Good stuff, Baaldam... Tarja was certainly something (I don't understand what the current tactics of Nightwish are - firing their vocalists every other year because they don't conform to their impossible and creepy expectations?).<br /> <br /> Beautiful lyrics, Prometheus878, really good stuff.<br /> <br /> Okay, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bbfy05y5Ukw\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> is not a marching song... more like a stadium anthem, but I think it's so good for the Tepet Legions...<br /> <br /> ... Too soon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13651-roswynn","name":"Roswynn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13651_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-27T06:39:26-07:00","id":1212254,"title":"","content":"Trax - AWESOME!! Found the tune, before they take it down - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qG9Y07pG9_k\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qG9Y07pG9_k</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13651-roswynn","name":"Roswynn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13651_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}